---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
	title="Methodology: Total Cost of Ownership" 
>
	<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 prose prose-blue">
		<h1>Total Cost of Ownership Methodology</h1>
		<p class="lead">
			CarScore.in separates Total Cash Outflow from Economic Total Cost of Ownership to prevent double-counting of asset equity.
		</p>

		<h2>Economic TCO Formula</h2>
		<pre>
Economic TCO = 
  Acquisition Price (On-Road)
  + Finance Interest & Fees
  + Total Insurance Premiums
  + Total Energy (Fuel/Charging)
  + Scheduled Servicing & Repairs
  + Consumables (Tyres/Battery)
  - Expected Resale Value
		</pre>

		<h2>Distance Normalization</h2>
		<p>
			All distance inputs (daily, monthly) are strictly normalized to an annual kilometre figure to align with standard Indian insurance and service schedules.
		</p>
	</div>
</Layout>
